      "After your site is hosted and live, the next 5 months of maintenance cost nothing extra. That covers content and text updates, bug fixes, dependency and security updates, backups, uptime and speed checks, and basic SEO health checks. After that you can continue on a monthly plan from â‚¹2,000 or just contact us when something needs changing.",
